{"content":[{"c":["WEALTH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Abundance, usually of money or material goods, whose value is ordinarily expressed in terms of some understood unit, such as a national currency. It is virtually synonymous with riches, and both may refer to family, friends, or even moral qualities."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["In the OT riches are a mark of favor with God (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.112.3","r":"Ps.112.3","rawR":"Ps.112.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.112.3","value":"Ps.112.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 112:3"},"), and he gives power to acquire wealth (",{"href":"?bref=Deut.8.18","r":"Deut.8.18","rawR":"Deut.8.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.8.18","value":"Deut.8.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 8:18"},"). Both the piety and the wealth of Job are well known (",{"href":"?bref=Job.1.1-3","r":"Job.1.1-3","rawR":"Job.1.1-3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Job.1.1-3","value":"Job.1.1-3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jb 1:1-3"},"). Solomon was perhaps the richest man who ever lived; God granted him “riches, possessions, and honor” because Solomon had asked for wisdom and discernment rather than material things (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.3.10-13","r":"1Kgs.3.10-13","rawR":"1Kgs.3.10-13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.3.10-13","value":"1Kgs.3.10-13"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 3:10-13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.1.11-12","r":"2Chr.1.11-12","rawR":"2Chr.1.11-12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.1.11-12","value":"2Chr.1.11-12"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 1:11-12"},"). But the Bible makes it clear that a person’s life does not consist in the abundance of his possessions (",{"href":"?bref=Luke.12.15","r":"Luke.12.15","rawR":"Luke.12.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.12.15","value":"Luke.12.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 12:15"},")."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":["In the NT wealthy men are often seen as godless—for example, the rich farmer (",{"href":"?bref=Luke.12.16-21","r":"Luke.12.16-21","rawR":"Luke.12.16-21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.12.16-21","value":"Luke.12.16-21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 12:16-21"},") and the rich man who neglected the beggar Lazarus (",{"href":"?bref=Luke.16.19-31","r":"Luke.16.19-31","rawR":"Luke.16.19-31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.16.19-31","value":"Luke.16.19-31"}],"t":"ref","v":"16:19-31"},"). The wealthy are condemned for oppression and greed (",{"href":"?bref=Jas.5.1-6","r":"Jas.5.1-6","rawR":"Jas.5.1-6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jas.5.1-6","value":"Jas.5.1-6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jas 5:1-6"},"). ",{"href":"?bref=Luke.6.24","r":"Luke.6.24","rawR":"Luke.6.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.6.24","value":"Luke.6.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Luke 6:24"}," pronounces woe against the rich, and all three synoptic Gospels speak of the dangers of riches (",{"href":"?bref=Matt.13.22","r":"Matt.13.22","rawR":"Matt.13.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Matt.13.22","value":"Matt.13.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mt 13:22"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Mark.4.19","r":"Mark.4.19","rawR":"Mark.4.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Mark.4.19","value":"Mark.4.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mk 4:19"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Luke.8.14","r":"Luke.8.14","rawR":"Luke.8.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.8.14","value":"Luke.8.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 8:14"},"). But not all rich men were bad. Jesus was buried in the tomb of a rich man from Arimathea, named Joseph (",{"href":"?bref=Matt.27.57","r":"Matt.27.57","rawR":"Matt.27.57","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Matt.27.57","value":"Matt.27.57"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mt 27:57"},"). Nicodemus, who provided lavishly for the burial of Jesus (",{"href":"?bref=John.19.39","r":"John.19.39","rawR":"John.19.39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"John.19.39","value":"John.19.39"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jn 19:39"},"), was “a ruler of the Jews” (",{"href":"?bref=John.3.1","r":"John.3.1","rawR":"John.3.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"John.3.1","value":"John.3.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"3:1"},") and probably a man of wealth."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Mammon_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Mammon_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Mammon_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Mammon"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Money_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Money_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Money_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Money"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Poorthe_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Poorthe_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Poorthe_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Poor, The"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Riches_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Riches_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Riches_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Riches"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Wages_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Wages_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Wages_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Wages"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Wealth","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Ps 112:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.112.3","rawQueryValue":"Ps.112.3","sourceRefExact":"Ps.112.3"},{"anchorText":"Dt 8:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.8.18","rawQueryValue":"Deut.8.18","sourceRefExact":"Deut.8.18"},{"anchorText":"Jb 1:1-3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Job.1.1-3","rawQueryValue":"Job.1.1-3","sourceRefExact":"Job.1.1-3"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 3:10-13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.3.10-13","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.3.10-13","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.3.10-13"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 1:11-12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.1.11-12","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.1.11-12","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.1.11-12"},{"anchorText":"Lk 12:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.12.15","rawQueryValue":"Luke.12.15","sourceRefExact":"Luke.12.15"},{"anchorText":"Lk 12:16-21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.12.16-21","rawQueryValue":"Luke.12.16-21","sourceRefExact":"Luke.12.16-21"},{"anchorText":"16:19-31","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.16.19-31","rawQueryValue":"Luke.16.19-31","sourceRefExact":"Luke.16.19-31"},{"anchorText":"Jas 5:1-6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jas.5.1-6","rawQueryValue":"Jas.5.1-6","sourceRefExact":"Jas.5.1-6"},{"anchorText":"Luke 6:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.6.24","rawQueryValue":"Luke.6.24","sourceRefExact":"Luke.6.24"},{"anchorText":"Mt 13:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Matt.13.22","rawQueryValue":"Matt.13.22","sourceRefExact":"Matt.13.22"},{"anchorText":"Mk 4:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Mark.4.19","rawQueryValue":"Mark.4.19","sourceRefExact":"Mark.4.19"},{"anchorText":"Lk 8:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.8.14","rawQueryValue":"Luke.8.14","sourceRefExact":"Luke.8.14"},{"anchorText":"Mt 27:57","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Matt.27.57","rawQueryValue":"Matt.27.57","sourceRefExact":"Matt.27.57"},{"anchorText":"Jn 19:39","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=John.19.39","rawQueryValue":"John.19.39","sourceRefExact":"John.19.39"},{"anchorText":"3:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=John.3.1","rawQueryValue":"John.3.1","sourceRefExact":"John.3.1"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"eac0cd1b572b7595d052633041eadfa9cc1aba99e7372247973d87462e96bd9a","sourceItemName":"Wealth","sourceItemOrder":20,"sourceMember":"Articles/W.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Wealth","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Wealth","title":"Wealth","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}